           ("Do Search profiles appear in AI Mode?", "Google is testing clickable creator and publisher names on video results in AI Mode that link to Search profiles."),
           ("Is a Search profile the same as a Business Profile?", "No. Business Profiles are for local businesses; Search profiles are for publishers and creators."),
           ("How do I set up a Search profile?", "Google directs eligible users to its Help Center and Search profile login."),
           ("Should I buy followers to qualify?", "No. It undermines trust and does not build a real audience."),
           ("Does a Search profile help local SEO?", "Indirectly, by tying your content and identity together; local rankings still rely on your Business Profile."),
